  MCP Tools
 An MCP tool is a function or executable capability that an MCP server exposes to a LLM or AI application to perform an action in the real world. Toolsets are a group of tools that are useful for a specific task. Using toolsets can help your agent perform better because it decreases the number of tools available to your agent.
